What this is, and is not
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is a reasoning framework. It produces structured thinking -- scenarios,
frameworks, and decision aids -- not guaranteed conclusions and not truth. The
human using it remains solely responsible for decisions made on its output.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Relationship to First Principle Codex OS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Genesis Mind inherits the epistemological base layer of First Principle Codex
OS -- Known/Inferred/Unknown separation, the proof standard, and the mandatory
self-critique gate. FPCOS is also Apache-2.0:

    https://github.com/ElmatadorZ/FirstPrincipleCodex-OS-Skill
